  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience total relaxation with the adidas Adissage 360Rec Mules. Engineered for 360-degree recovery, these street-ready kicks feature tactile massage dots on the footbed and vamp to soothe tired feet after intense training. The flexible, ribbed outsole ensures smooth movement and reliable grip whether you are cooling down at the gym or lounging at home.<br><ul><li>Synthetic upper with tactile dots provides a modern look</li><li>Cloudfoam footbed with recovery domes offers plush comfort</li><li>Flexible ribbed outsole ensures superior traction and grip</li><li>Slip-on construction allows for easy on and off</li><li>adidas logo adds an authentic touch to the minimalist design</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Synthetic upper</li><li>Synthetic sockliner</li><li>Synthetic outsole</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Regular fit</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas adissage 360rec Mules - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Core Black/Core Black/Core Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU